{# The plain text body of the moderation notice. The three links are the point
   of the whole message: each carries a signed token, works once, and lands on
   a page with a button rather than acting on being opened, so that a mail
   scanner following links cannot moderate this site. #}
{% if comment.source == 'webmention' %}A page has linked to{% else %}Somebody has commented on{% endif %} “{{ post.title }}” and it is waiting for you.

{{ post.url }}

From: {{ comment.author }}
{% if comment.website %}
Site: {{ comment.website }}
{% endif %}
{% if comment.url %}
Page: {{ comment.url }}
{% endif %}
When: {{ comment.submitted }}

{{ comment.text | trim if comment.text | trim else '(nothing was said — it is a ' + comment.kind + ')' }}

--
{% for choice in actions %}{{ choice.label }}: {{ choice.url }}
{% endfor %}
{% if carried and carried.length %}

The same page carries {{ carried.length }} more {{ 'reply' if carried.length == 1 else 'replies' }} from other pages, waiting too.
{% for reply in carried %}

--
From: {{ reply.author }}
{% if reply.website %}
Site: {{ reply.website }}
{% endif %}
{% if reply.url %}
Page: {{ reply.url }}
{% endif %}

{{ reply.text | trim if reply.text | trim else '(nothing was said)' }}

{% for choice in reply.actions %}
{{ choice.label }}: {{ choice.url }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

--
{% endif %}
